{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 37, "ref": "genesis 27:37", "book": "genesis", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 27, "translation": "Lalu Yitshak menjawab dan berkata kepada Esav: Sudah kujadikan dia tuan atas kamu, dan ⟨את⟩ semua saudaranya telah kuberikan kepadanya sebagai hamba, dan dengan gandum dan air anggur aku telah menopangnya — maka bagi kamu sekarang, apakah yang dapat kubuat, anakku?", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויען", "gloss": "Lalu menjawab"}, {"surface": "יצחק", "gloss": "Yitshak"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "dan berkata"}, {"surface": "לעשו", "gloss": "kepada Esav"}, {"surface": "הן", "gloss": "Sudah"}, {"surface": "גביר", "gloss": "tuan"}, {"surface": "שמתיו", "gloss": "kujadikan dia"}, {"surface": "לך", "gloss": "atas kamu"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "semua saudaranya"}, {"surface": "כל", "gloss": "semua"}, {"surface": "אחיו", "gloss": "saudaranya"}, {"surface": "נתתי", "gloss": "telah kuberikan"}, {"surface": "לו", "gloss": "kepadanya"}, {"surface": "לעבדים", "gloss": "sebagai hamba"}, {"surface": "ודגן", "gloss": "dan dengan gandum"}, {"surface": "ותירש", "gloss": "dan air anggur"}, {"surface": "סמכתיו", "gloss": "aku telah menopangnya"}, {"surface": "ולכה", "gloss": "maka bagi kamu"}, {"surface": "אפוא", "gloss": "sekarang"}, {"surface": "מה", "gloss": "apakah"}, {"surface": "אעשה", "gloss": "yang dapat kubuat"}, {"surface": "בני", "gloss": "anakku"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T11:05:14.207779637Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}